## English

### Overview

Bright Calculator is a calculator app for iPhone and iPad. We designed it to work **without an account** and **without our own servers** for your calculations or personal profile.

This policy explains what information the app uses, how it is handled, and your choices.

### Information we do not collect

We do **not** collect, store on our servers, or sell:

- Your name, email, or phone number (unless you email us for support)
- Calculation history for analytics or advertising
- Precise location
- Contacts, calendars, or health data
- Advertising identifiers for cross-app tracking

We do **not** use third-party analytics or advertising SDKs in the app.

### Information stored on your device

The app saves preferences **locally on your device** using iOS storage (for example, `UserDefaults`), such as:

- Selected theme, colors, fonts, and button style
- Custom themes you create
- Whether Pro features are unlocked (a local cache of purchase status)

This data stays on your device unless you delete the app or reset the device.

### Photo library (optional)

If you use **Pro** and choose a **custom photo background**, the app requests access to your photo library. You pick a photo; it is used only to display your wallpaper inside the app. We do not upload your photos to our servers.

You can deny or revoke access anytime in **Settings → Privacy & Security → Photos**.

### Purchases (Apple StoreKit)

**Bright Calculator Pro** is sold through **Apple In-App Purchase**. Payment and transaction data are processed by **Apple**, not by us. We only receive information needed to unlock Pro on your device (for example, whether the purchase is active), according to Apple’s rules.

See Apple’s privacy policy: [https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/](https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/)

### Internet use

The app may connect to the internet only for App Store / purchase-related services provided by Apple. We do not operate a user login backend for the calculator.

### Children

The app is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

### Changes

We may update this policy. The “Last updated” date at the top will change. Continued use of the app after changes means you accept the updated policy.

### Contact

Questions about privacy: **malkovych@gmail.com**

